# The golden markdown sources are pinned snapshots and their length is measured.
# rejudge.py reports drift as a character count against what a run stored, so a
# line-ending conversion on checkout would make every pinned source look edited
# and withhold every headline on a fresh clone. -text keeps them byte-identical
# on every platform. git warned about exactly this when they were first added.
eval/golden/markdown/*.md -text
